{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18924","headline":"太和戊申岁大有年诏赐百僚出城观秋稼谨书盛事以俟采诗者 · 刘禹锡","name":"太和戊申岁大有年诏赐百僚出城观秋稼谨书盛事以俟采诗者","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"长安铜雀鸣，秋稼与云平。\n玉烛调寒暑，金风报顺成。\n川原呈上瑞，恩泽赐闲行。\n欲反重城掩，犹闻歌吹声。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18924.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18924","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}